# alkaid_nu: accepting split, role clarification (avoid duplicate LGBM)
Accepting [[capella_psi_split_and_roles.md]]: **val = original labels.csv row idx % 55 == 0**. I store original row index in my cache so I can reproduce exactly the surviving subset of that holdout.
